          <div>
            <h3>Accompaniment and outings</h3>
            <p>Doctor and hospital appointments, with registration, waiting=
 and consultation handled and the doctor's advice sent to you. Also temple =
visits, family functions, property visits, and airport or railway station d=
rops.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"svc">
          <svg viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" aria-hidden=3D"true"><rect x=3D"4" y=
