            <p>Pharmacy collection and home delivery, medication reminders =
as prescribed, and booking of routine check-ups and tests, with reports bro=
ught home.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"svc">
          <svg viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" aria-hidden=3D"true"><rect x=3D"4" y=
