2h16"></path></svg>
          <div>
            <h3>Errands and paperwork</h3>
            <p>Groceries, bill payments, bank visits, documents and governm=
ent-office errands, carried out and reported back to you. We do not provide=
 legal, tax or financial advice.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"svc">
