/svg>
          <div>
            <h3>Companionship</h3>
            <p>A walk, a conversation, a temple visit or an outing. Time wi=
th someone who listens and makes the day a little brighter.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"svc">
          <svg viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"M4 5h1=
